<section class="sanoozy-legal-block">
  <h2>1. Delivery coverage</h2>
  <p>
    Sanoozy delivers across Pakistan. Delivery availability for your area is confirmed at checkout. If we cannot deliver
    to your address, our team will contact you on WhatsApp or phone to arrange an alternative.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="sanoozy-legal-block">
  <h2>2. Order processing</h2>
  <p>
    Orders are typically processed within 1–2 business days after confirmation. Orders placed on weekends or public
    holidays may be processed on the next working day. You will receive a confirmation once your order has been received.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="sanoozy-legal-block">
  <h2>3. Delivery timelines</h2>
  <p>
    Estimated delivery times depend on your city and the courier partner assigned to your order. As a general guide:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Major cities: typically 2–4 business days after dispatch</li>
    <li>Other cities and remote areas: typically 3–7 business days after dispatch</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    These timelines are estimates and may vary due to weather, courier delays, or high-order periods. We will keep you
    updated if there is a significant delay.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="sanoozy-legal-block">
  <h2>4. Shipping charges</h2>
  <p>
    Shipping charges, if any, are shown at checkout before you confirm your order. Charges may vary by location, order
    size, or active promotions. Any free-shipping offer will be clearly displayed on the product or checkout page.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="sanoozy-legal-block">
  <h2>5. Tracking your order</h2>
  <p>
    Once your order is dispatched, you can track it from
    <a href="{{ routes.account_url }}">My Orders</a>
    in your account, or contact us with your order number. We are happy to share the latest courier update over WhatsApp.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="sanoozy-legal-block">
  <h2>6. Delivery attempts and incorrect addresses</h2>
  <p>
    Please make sure your name, phone number, and delivery address are correct before placing the order. If a delivery
    fails because the address is incomplete, the phone is unreachable, or nobody is available to receive the parcel,
    extra delivery charges may apply for a re-attempt.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="sanoozy-legal-block">
  <h2>7. Damaged or missing items</h2>
  <p>
    If your parcel arrives damaged, opened, or with missing items, please contact us within 48 hours of delivery and
    share photos of the package and products. We will review the case under our
    <a href="{{ pages['refund-policy'].url | default: '/pages/refund-policy' }}">Refund Policy</a>.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="sanoozy-legal-block">
  <h2>8. Need help?</h2>
  <p>
    For shipping questions, message us on WhatsApp at 0314 8232224 or email
    <a href="mailto:contact.sanoozy@gmail.com">contact.sanoozy@gmail.com</a>
    with your order number.
  </p>
</section>
